---
export const title = 'Usage';
export const order = 100;
import DemoComponentCard from '../../../../components/DemoComponentCard.astro';
---

<p>
  <code>wc-stat</code> is a KPI tile: a <code>label</code>, a <code>value</code> formatted with
  <code>Intl.NumberFormat</code> using <code>format</code>, and the change since the last period. The
  change is worked out from <code>previous</code>, or given as <code>delta</code>. An arrow shows its
  direction and the color whether it is good news.
</p>

<DemoComponentCard lang={'html'}>
  <div style='width: 100%; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(14rem, 1fr)); gap: 1rem;'>
    <wc-stat
      label='Monthly revenue'
      value='12400'
      previous='11480'
      format='{"style": "currency", "currency": "USD", "maximumFractionDigits": 0}'
      comparison='vs last month'
    >
      <wc-sparkline slot='trend' data='[9800, 10400, 10900, 11480, 12400]'></wc-sparkline>
    </wc-stat>
    <wc-stat label='Active users' value='8210' previous='8640' help='Users who signed in during the last 30 days'></wc-stat>
    <wc-stat label='Signups' value='312' previous='312'></wc-stat>
  </div>
</DemoComponentCard>

<h3>Change</h3>
<p>
  <code>delta-format="percent"</code> (the default) shows the change as a share of the previous
  value; <code>delta</code> is then a fraction, so <code>0.08</code> is 8%.
  <code>delta-format="absolute"</code> shows the amount, formatted like the value. A value that
  moves the <code>positive</code> way (<code>up</code> by default) is green, the other way red. Set
  <code>positive="down"</code> for metrics where less is better, and <code>none</code> for neutral
  ones.
</p>

<DemoComponentCard lang={'html'}>
  <div style='width: 100%; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(14rem, 1fr)); gap: 1rem;'>
    <wc-stat
      label='Churn'
      value='0.031'
      delta='-0.004'
      delta-format='absolute'
      positive='down'
      format='{"style": "percent", "maximumFractionDigits": 1}'
    ></wc-stat>
    <wc-stat label='Response time' value='420' previous='380' positive='down' format='{"style": "unit", "unit": "millisecond"}'></wc-stat>
    <wc-stat label='Tickets' value='96' previous='88' positive='none'></wc-stat>
  </div>
</DemoComponentCard>
